1
00:00:00,395 --> 00:00:01,905
Button animation.

2
00:00:01,945 --> 00:00:06,687
Water, a fish, a frog and more,
beside the volume key you press.

3
00:00:07,953 --> 00:00:09,838
Open Button animation.

4
00:00:09,878 --> 00:00:14,787
In Gesture Volume, under Advanced
features, tap Button animation.

5
00:00:15,121 --> 00:00:18,981
Turn it on. Switch on Animate
the volume buttons.

6
00:00:19,021 --> 00:00:22,264
The preview at the top plays
it, with nothing to press.

7
00:00:22,551 --> 00:00:26,086
Press a volume key.
Go home and press volume up:

8
00:00:26,126 --> 00:00:29,193
water ripples out from
the very key you pressed.

9
00:00:31,173 --> 00:00:36,383
Pick one. Back in Button animation,
scroll down to Animation and tap one.

10
00:00:36,423 --> 00:00:38,567
Every animation is free.

11
00:00:39,030 --> 00:00:40,890
Each with a sound of its own.

12
00:00:40,930 --> 00:00:44,145
Frog jump, Swing women, Cat, Balloons:

13
00:00:44,185 --> 00:00:47,285
tap one, and the preview
plays it with its sound.

14
00:00:48,001 --> 00:00:52,561
Hold for a big one. On the glass,
a press lets a balloon float away.

15
00:00:52,601 --> 00:00:55,518
Hold the key, and it
fills until it bursts.

16
00:00:57,605 --> 00:00:59,190
Line it up with your keys.

17
00:00:59,230 --> 00:01:02,895
Under Where your buttons are,
pick a key and slide Position.

18
00:01:02,935 --> 00:01:06,935
As you slide, the press shows
on the glass, right beside it.

19
00:01:07,319 --> 00:01:12,154
Sound and feel. Each animation
plays its own sound at every press.

20
00:01:12,194 --> 00:01:16,602
Then pick how it buzzes, how long
it stays and how fast it moves.

21
00:01:16,914 --> 00:01:19,094
With the Quick slider, or alone.

22
00:01:19,134 --> 00:01:21,369
Pause plays the animation alone.

23
00:01:21,409 --> 00:01:24,062
Show both brings up
the Quick slider with it.

24
00:01:25,168 --> 00:01:28,233
That is the whole series.
Thanks for watching.
